| `src/store/planning.js` → `loadTasks` | **Reads only `page: 1`** and never follows `has_next` | ❌ **root cause** |
| `src/components/kanban/board/PlanningRangeFilter.vue` | Ranges = Today / Last 7 days / Last 30 days / Custom (no "All"); default = last 30 days | ✅ requirements met |
