**So the request is correct — the view doesn't change because `loadTasks()` only ever consumes the first page of the paginated envelope.** The envelope caps `page_size` at 100, so of ~1180 tasks only the first 100 (page 1) were ever pushed into `state.tasks`. Fix: aggregate **all** pages before committing to state.

